      "name": "Kathy Van Zandt",
      "time": "2026-08-31T21:22:26.731124",
      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "content": "For sure you know what, I'm gonna see if he's available one second.",
      "name": "Jules Nicolas",
      "time": "2026-08-31T21:22:42.279069",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "4886812291923968"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay. So grant is not available right now, but I think I'm a little up to speed with voids gonna happen. So about the pod, the pod is going to be delivered in which address?",
      "name": "Jules Nicolas",
      "time": "2026-08-31T21:24:15.879069",
