    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCs9LP7swgM",
      "content": "Okay. So right now we have a storage pod at our current house. And I had when I talked to I think it was Dana when I talked to her on our FaceTime call.",
      "name": "Kathy Van Zandt",
      "time": "2026-08-31T21:24:27.931124",
