      "time": "2026-08-31T21:24:40.153124",
      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCs9LP7swgM",
      "content": "I had mentioned that I would have the pod delivered to the new house and just have the movers unload it there but what I would prefer is to have them just unload everything out of the pod at our current house and just move it along with our other stuff.",
      "name": "Kathy Van Zandt",
      "time": "2026-08-31T21:24:44.731124",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Got it. Okay, so if we're gonna do it like that, we might need to adjust a few things. Let me see.",
      "name": "Jules Nicolas",
      "time": "2026-08-31T21:25:03.879069",
