    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCs9LP7swgM",
      "content": "And the other kind of caveat is that our, that pod takes quite a bit of our driveway, and our driveway is slopes down and it's so I was wondering if that would be okay with the moving trucks or if that would, if that would work.",
      "name": "Kathy Van Zandt",
      "time": "2026-08-31T21:25:14.131124",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Got it. Okay. So the main thing is the items might not fit. Like everything might not fit in just two trucks including the stuff in the pod. So that is the main issue right now. That I can see, let me see.",
      "name": "Jules Nicolas",
      "time": "2026-08-31T21:25:35.079069",
