    },
    {
      "content": "So, yeah, the problem would be if you, if we're going to be unloading everything all, all the items in the pot, and your current at current house and then load everything to the truck and then move everything to the new house. We might need to add a third truck. Unfortunately we do not have availability for that this Friday for the third truck. What we can do is let me see.",
